# Ennis, Debate Moderator: with no other creature to exile, entering does nothing; but when Bot1 later that turn exiles a card with
# Swords to Plowshares (Bot2's Ornithopter), a card was put into exile this turn, so Ennis grows at the beginning of Bot1's end step.
# The turn before it has no exile, and no counter.

